        "source_page_id": "kansai-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p001",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の進め方",
            "text": "最初に極座標の定義と放物線の焦点・準線を図に結びます。共有点問題はkを水平線の高さと見て、増減表の境界値で場合分けします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Ⅰ 解答",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 円 \\(C\\)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(C\\) 上の点 \\(P\\) の極座標を \\((r,\\theta)\\) とすると、図1より \\(OP=OA\\cos\\theta\\) なので \\(r=2\\cos\\theta\\)。極 \\(O\\) は \\(\\theta=\\frac\\pi2\\) のとき \\(r=0\\) を満たす。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r=2\\cos\\theta",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a1-circle-figure",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 放物線 \\(D\\)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(D\\) 上の点 \\(Q\\) の極座標を \\((r,\\theta)\\)、\\(Q\\) から準線に引いた垂線の足を \\(H\\) とする。\\(Q,H\\) の座標はそれぞれ \\((r\\cos\\theta,r\\sin\\theta)\\)、\\((\\frac a2,r\\sin\\theta)\\) である。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(a>0\\) のとき、\\(OQ=QH\\) より \\(r=\\frac a2-r\\cos\\theta\\) となる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r=\\frac{a}{2(1+\\cos\\theta)}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(a<0\\) のとき、\\(OQ=QH\\) より \\(r=r\\cos\\theta-\\frac a2\\) となる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r=\\frac{-a}{2(1-\\cos\\theta)}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a1-parabola-figures",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kansai-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "以上より放物線 \\(D\\) の極方程式は次の通りである。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a>0:\\quad r=\\frac{a}{2(1+\\cos\\theta)}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a<0:\\quad r=\\frac{-a}{2(1-\\cos\\theta)}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "2つのグラフの共有点の個数は、方程式 \\(f(x)=g(x)\\) の実数解の個数に等しい。\\(2\\cos x=\\frac{k}{2(1-\\cos x)}\\) から \\(-4\\cos^2x+4\\cos x=k\\) となる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(h(x)=-4\\cos^2x+4\\cos x\\ (0<x<2\\pi)\\) とおき、\\(y=h(x)\\) と直線 \\(y=k\\) の共有点の個数を調べる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "h'(x)=4\\sin x(2\\cos x-1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(h'(x)=0\\) となるのは \\(x=\\frac\\pi3,\\pi,\\frac{5\\pi}3\\) で、\\(h(\\frac\\pi3)=h(\\frac{5\\pi}3)=1\\)、\\(h(\\pi)=-8\\) である。また、両端での極限値は0である。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "caption": "\\(y=h(x)\\) の増減表",
            "headers": [
              "\\(x\\)",
              "\\((0)\\)",
              "…",
              "\\(\\frac\\pi3\\)",
              "…",
              "\\(\\pi\\)",
              "…",
              "\\(\\frac{5\\pi}3\\)",
              "…",
              "\\((2\\pi)\\)"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "\\(h'(x)\\)",
                "",
                "+",
                "0",
                "−",
                "0",
                "+",
                "0",
                "−",
                ""
              ],
              [
                "\\(h(x)\\)",
                "\\((0)\\)",
                "↗",
                "1",
                "↘",
                "−8",
                "↗",
                "1",
                "↘",
                "\\((0)\\)"
              ]
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kansai-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a3-intersection-graph",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "図4の \\(y=h(x)\\) と直線 \\(y=k\\) の共有点の個数から、求める共有点の個数は次の通りである。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "structured_list",
            "style": "cases",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "0個",
                "text": "\\(k<-8\\) または \\(1<k\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "1個",
                "text": "\\(k=-8\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "2個",
                "text": "\\(-8<k\\leq0\\) または \\(k=1\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "4個",
                "text": "\\(0<k<1\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "解説《円と放物線の極方程式、\\(\\cos x\\) を含む関数で表された2本の曲線の共有点の個数》",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(1) 放物線は焦点までの距離と準線までの距離が等しい点の軌跡である。円、放物線のいずれも座標の方程式をつくり、\\(x=r\\cos\\theta,y=r\\sin\\theta\\) として整理しても同じ結論に達する。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(2) \\(y=g(x)\\) をそのまま微分して増減表をつくる方法もあるが、\\(k\\) の符号で場合分けが必要になる。\\(y=h(x)\\) と \\(x\\) 軸に平行な直線 \\(y=k\\) の共有点の個数と捉えて単純化する。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の進め方",
            "text": "すべて平方差または連続和を因数の積へ直します。因数の偶奇と大小を確認し、不適な中央組や長さ1の組を調整します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Ⅱ 解答",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(n^2-m^2=(n+m)(n-m)\\) であり、\\(m,n\\) は自然数なので、\\(n+m\\) と \\(n-m\\) はともに奇数、またはともに偶数である。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(n+m)(n-m)=2024=2^3\\cdot11\\cdot23",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kansai-medical-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "積が2024となる因数の組のうち、両方が偶数となる4組を用いる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(n-m,n+m)=(2,1012),(4,506)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(n-m,n+m)=(22,92),(44,46)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "m=\\frac{(n+m)-(n-m)}2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "n=\\frac{(n+m)+(n-m)}2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(m,n)=(505,507),(251,255)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(m,n)=(35,57),(1,45)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "Ⅱ (1)",
                "value": "4通り"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(n-m)(n+m)=2025=3^4\\cdot5^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "2025の正の約数は15個ですべて奇数である。\\((45,45)\\) は \\(m\\geq1\\) に反するため除き、残る14個を2つずつ組にする。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
